# Riverpod Template - Project Context

## Overview
- **Template**: Flutter + Riverpod starter (AI-first from the start)
- **Architecture**: Layer-based with Riverpod state management
- **Code Generation**: Use `@riverpod` for providers, run build_runner after changes
- **Environments**: dev, prod (flavors)

## Project Structure

```
lib/
├── core/           # (optional) Shared infrastructure
├── data/           # Repositories, API clients, Firebase
├── domain/         # Domain models (Freezed)
├── presentation/   # UI by feature (views, controllers, widgets)
├── routing/        # GoRouter, AppRoute constants
├── services/       # Core services
├── theme/          # Colors, text styles
├── utils/          # Helpers, network, extensions
└── manifests/      # Auto-generated feature manifests (for AI)
```

## Build Commands

```bash
# Run
flutter run --flavor dev

# Build
flutter build apk --flavor dev
```

## Code Generation

```bash
# After @riverpod / @freezed changes
dart run build_runner build -d

# After structural changes (routes, features)
dart run scripts/generate_feature_manifests.dart
```
